    {
      "sentenceIndex": 1,
      "file": "qa/out/independent-captions-v1/s01-f00110.png",
      "sha256": "807a4f2f781271b8998293ccee7932831822311b082e02e432ad6e4270dc8b2d",
      "frame": 110,
      "text": "一百名囚徒不能交谈，每次只有一人进房，只能看和改变一盏初始为灭的灯。"
    },
    {
      "sentenceIndex": 14,
      "file": "qa/out/independent-captions-v1/s07-f02805.png",
      "sha256": "5b24b4d129b5ae37f09ac849d5906cddcc3da084ba5b69da9f3aefb2b36476bc",
      "frame": 2805,
      "text": "随后一号又看见灯灭，但他已经成功发过，所以不能再开灯，计数也不会重复增加。"
    },
    {
      "sentenceIndex": 15,
      "file": "qa/out/independent-captions-v1/s08-f03006.png",
      "sha256": "8ee0fcca9c721d623ebc40b703543b962dfae2c99d525bf0275e88b2ecde5059",
      "frame": 3006,
      "text": "二号还没有发过，这次来时灯灭，终于能开灯，并记住已经发过。"
    },
    {
      "sentenceIndex": 28,
      "file": "qa/out/independent-captions-v1/s14-f05880.png",
      "sha256": "804aca666c7d427e06bf6f310b430ab860c62593e3c923744af3cc2352a2247e",
      "frame": 5880,
      "text": "这样，九十九次接收就对应九十九个不同的人，一盏只有亮灭两态的灯，也能留下所有人来过的可靠证据。"
    }
  ],
